```

**How it satisfies each requirement:**

| Requirement | Mechanism |
|---|---|
| Respect sharing (OWD Private) | `with sharing` on the class + `Database.query` executes in the calling context, so row-level sharing is enforced. |
| Ordered by `Name ASC` | `ORDER BY Name ASC` in the SOQL. |
| Include `Id`, `Name` always | Unconditionally added to the field list (standard fields available whenever the object is). |
| Custom fields absent when FLS denies read | Each of the three custom fields is only added to the SELECT list after `getDescribe().isAccessible()` returns `true`. Because they are never queried, they are simply not populated on the returned SObjects (they are "absent," not explicitly set to null). |
