**How it satisfies each requirement:**

| Requirement | How it's met |
|---|---|
| Only on update, Amount changed | `TriggerAction.AfterUpdate` interface + `oppOld.Amount != oppNew.Amount` guard |
| Task fields | `Subject = 'Amount changed'`, `WhatId = oppNew.Id`, `Status = 'Completed'` |
| At most one task per opp per transaction | `TriggerBase.idToNumberOfTimesSeenAfterUpdate.get(Id) != 1` skips the second trigger fire caused by the rounding action's DML |
| One DML for 200 records | All `Task` records are collected in a single list and inserted with one `insert` statement |
| Order 10 (before rounding at 20) | `Order__c` = 10 in the metadata record |
| Description required | `Description__c` populated |
| Rounding action unchanged | No modification to `TA_Opportunity_RoundAmount` |

